      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-03-26T21:05:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These locks are essentially shared between the host and the guest and need to apply to all processes system wide. IIUC, standard mutex locks need to be locked and unlocked by the same processes, and we can\u0027t (yet!) share a mutex lock between guest and host. So we are using our current scheme.",
